{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51689","headline":"下山过梅根 · 罗隐","name":"下山过梅根","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸叶经秋坠晚枝，袅烟凌鬓促征期。\n家从泽国谁能问，路在侯门自不知。\n但恐老侵多病日，每忧忙过少年时。\n可怜江上人堪笑，独倚残阳弄钓丝。\n（同上卷八《杂着篇·艺文》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}